flowchart TD
    A[Load Room Definition] --> B[Load Base Room Layout]
    B --> C[Validate Required Sockets]
    C --> D[Place Entry and Door Modules]
    D --> E[Place Encounter Module]
    E --> F[Place Optional Merchant Event and Treasure Modules]
    F --> G[Place Optional Environment Content]
    G --> H[Restore Room Runtime State]
    H --> I[Bind Door Connections and Interaction Prompts]
    I --> J{Validation Passed?}
    J -->|No| K[Report Configuration Error and Block Play]
    J -->|Yes| L[Enable Exploration]
    L --> M[Record Interaction and Encounter Changes]
    M --> N[Persist State Before Door Transition]
